      <section id="issuer"><div class="header-wrapper"><h3 id="x4-7-issuer"><bdi class="secno">4.7 </bdi>Issuer</h3><a class="self-link" href="#issuer" aria-label="Permalink for Section 4.7"></a></div>


        <p>
This specification defines a property for expressing the <a data-link-type="dfn|abstract-op" href="#dfn-issuers" class="internalDFN" id="ref-for-dfn-issuers-17">issuer</a> of
